# Gym Identity T1 (Tidehaven): pool-tile lagoon floor — Cascade blues as glazed 4px pool tiles with pale grout, the gym's recorded poolblock/lifering water register drawn into the floor itself. Tidehaven's own floor — an indoor pool tile, not open sea: grout grid and tile tint steps split it from every surf and shore sand in the game.
